---
import Layout from '@/layouts/Base.astro';
const lang = 'es';
const t = (await import('../../translations/es.json')).default;
---

<Layout lang={lang} title={t.nav.samples} description="Important texts translated into Simpli.">
  <h1>{t.nav.samples}</h1>
  <p>Sample texts in Simpli.</p>
  <h2>Universal Declaration of Human Rights (Article 1)</h2>
  <div class="simpli-block">ol hyuman pipol born fri and ikwal.
dey haw digniti and rait.
dey haw rizon and konshens and shud akt wit gud spirit tu oder pipol.</div>
  <h2>Short dialogue</h2>
  <div class="simpli-block">wer yu from ?
mi from frans.

yu liw here ?
yes, mi liw here now.

wat yu du ?
mi wok wit komputer and langwij.</div>

  <h2>Why Simpli? (longer text)</h2>
  <div class="simpli-block">Simpli bi a simpil langwij. Yu kan lern it fast. It haw no hard gramar. Word kam from inglish bat de speling bi izi. Evri sound haw wan leta. Yu rid wat yu sii. Meni pipol in de wold no som inglish. For dey Simpli bi a briy. Dey kan yuse it tu tok tu oder. Dey kan yuse it for wok or trawel. Wi want de wold tu haw wan simpil langwij. Simpli kan bi dat langwij.</div>
</Layout>
